[{"title":"雪后出长安门见西山甚近","author":"袁宗道","text":"雪后天街绝点尘，西山一秣白于银。\n云边蹬道层层出，马首峰峦叠叠真。\n瑶岛分明连绛阙，玉龙夭矫贴青旻。\n却怜往岁曾游处，十里桃花覆角巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45813,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下","author":"袁宗道","text":"衰发萧萧不满梳，头颅四十欲何如？\n风尘眯眼花医治，名利关心酒破除。\n谈畏友朋焚麈尾，病休人吏掩蜗庐。\n虞翻骨体终难媚，高枕从他笑拙疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45814,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京察见部自嘲","author":"袁宗道","text":"拥肿类寒樗，何功滥石渠。\n编摩中圣误，候谒坐禅疏。\n应客杂诙语，嗔奴索报书。\n似浮兼似浅，不黜待何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45815,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春和陆放翁韵 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"四十方强已厌官，催人头白是长安。\n新诗繁芜多随意，夜读昏花觉损肝。\n懒向时人争巧拙，久游畏路耐咸酸。\n春来转忆家园好，社鼓村醪日日欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45816,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春和陆放翁韵 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"冷淡何须厌一官，乌钞丛里好偷安。\n厌将资级污牙颊，岂有风波入肺肝。\n客枕才春梦已乱，病肱将雪骨先酸。\n愧无丝竹堪陶写，未怕儿童觉损欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45817,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"袁宗道","text":"宦味侵衰诗味长，道缘渐熟俗缘轻。\n时从故纸觅高士，老结同参进曲生。\n轻涤砚尘留墨绣，缓添炉火听瓶笙。\n热官弃置酸寒福，贫士收来应不争。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45818,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪晨入直","author":"袁宗道","text":"将曙气阴阴，寒侵烛焰沈。\n云浓禽路涩，雪厚象踪深。\n足滑全依仆，衣单紧束衿。\n人间饶乐事，何业化书蟫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45819,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感戏作","author":"袁宗道","text":"占毕半生舌本强，编摩十载砚心凹。\n赋归谁假乘风翼，叹老难煎黏日胶。\n饱食大官真似鼠，厌逢俗客欲称猫。\n移家澧水知何日，拟塞丸泥自结茆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45820,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"火神庙道士","author":"袁宗道","text":"事火道人事，翻来水上居。\n鹤窥烹石处，鱼呷洗丹馀。\n世业五禽戏，家藏八叠书。\n南陵虽有命，噀酒自能除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45821,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱平涵太史册封荣藩","author":"袁宗道","text":"暂抛铜马向天涯，官柳千条拂使车。\n驿路开尊遨月石，仙源立马问桃花。\n水平青草骚人宅，山绕朱门帝子家。\n客里潘舆谁得似，泛觞还采廖平砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45822,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾升伯太史奉命如梁赋此为别","author":"袁宗道","text":"柳烟槐雾接河梁，树杪分明见太行。\n月上山城征马急，雨过汴水露荷香。\n赠行古帖来东邸，侑酒新词出宪王。\n此去洞庭秋正好，烟波声里说袁郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45823,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李湘洲太史赍诏之浙","author":"袁宗道","text":"险句临岩得，禅心遇水闲。\n只凭一纸诏，踏遍万重山。\n林屋朝乘屣，松篁夜扣关。\n定从委宛去，载取异书还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45824,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿舒翁，大行父也","author":"袁宗道","text":"东鲁真儒行，南华达士怀。\n无心甘抱瓮，有手但持杯。\n杖溅龙潭瀑，衣黏灵洞苔。\n仙郎奉紫綍，新自日边来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45825,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夹山母舅之任太原 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"匹马穿云去，装中半道书。\n官贫僮仆惯，县僻送迎疏。\n扫叶炊红稻，连泉供白鱼。\n登山公事了，何处显村谞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45826,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夹山母舅之任太原 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"身为石室主，闲与道人期。\n判讼虎知法，升堂猿报时。\n泉声寒井邑，山翠染城池。\n应有西游草，怀甥得几诗？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45827,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别谢在杭司理东昌 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"一笑平原去，高才聊寄栖。\n闲谈皆有韵，得句半无题。\n近海观云黑，登楼看岳低。\n应怜征税苦，宽大救三齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45828,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别谢在杭司理东昌 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"万户苍烟里，孤城绿水隈。\n郡斋多近草，狱户长新苔。\n国变怀砖俗，人惊判剑才。\n公馀寻古迹，先上鲁连台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45829,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日同钟樊桐、黄慎轩、方子公及两弟饮崇国寺僧房，得家字","author":"袁宗道","text":"老僧爱竹石，点缀似山家。\n密筱梳风冷，流觞逐水斜。\n谈慵思薤叶，颊醉吐榴花。\n一缕林烟歇，阇黎供露芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45830,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿郑大司马","author":"袁宗道","text":"青山归去为功成，笑看人间利与名。\n三径新来称小隐，一身旧日是长城。\n石分甲乙屯云气，竹长儿孙学凤声。\n智似子房身较健，不劳辟谷得长生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45831,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王以明例贡归小竹林","author":"袁宗道","text":"白襕著破换青衫，归去山斋自在眠。\n医俗止留千个竹，买闲先卖一区田。\n携妻烧笋旋沽酒，避客浇花自引泉。\n怪得新诗奇僻甚，苦吟骨削类枯禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45832,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"袁宗道","text":"看看衰症到颐腮，宿业泥人未拟回。\n醉里童颜金炸色，愁来宦味蜡成灰。\n此心宁与形俱皱，得道何妨老见催。\n已约寅年归净社，盖头茅在夹山隈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45833,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看华严经","author":"袁宗道","text":"检点头颅只自怜，双轮相逼入颓龄。\n销除蜗角千生业，凭仗龙宫半部经。\n简事只嫌多鬓发，断淫先拟绝荤腥。\n六时起坐疏钞里，剥啄由他不启扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"袁宗道","text":"一自辞亲返禁林，随人啼笑到如今。\n三生白业施功浅，半世乌纱染俗深。\n往事休污念佛口，新来初歇著书心。\n朝朝顶礼金容后，一榻跏趺对水沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邵芝南太史册封唐藩","author":"袁宗道","text":"暂辍编摩去，行行入豫疆。\n驱车游宛洛，立马问韩梁。\n雨洗沙溪净，风传路草香。\n云霞添旅橐，花鸟贮吟囊。\n白水秋澄彻，丹山夜郁苍。\n剪桐分帝子，酌醴醉仙郎。\n泛涓思文叔，登台忆武乡。\n民艰今可问，何似昔南阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鼓吹","author":"袁宗道","text":"儿童村巷竞走，鼓吹驿路喧阗。\n何似池塘两部，宫商渐近自然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45837,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翻前意","author":"袁宗道","text":"驿路红尘鼓吹，池塘青草蛙声。\n本来都无音响，雅俗欲向谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45838,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄粱梦三首 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"车帷且勿卷，吾愧见卢公。\n广陌争驰骋，安知非枕中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45839,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄粱梦三首 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"枕中天地宽，梦里年光速。\n屈指威音前，黄粱曾几熟？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45840,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄粱梦三首 其三","author":"袁宗道","text":"共道梦非真，谁知醒复伪。\n飞升羡吕公，亦是梦中事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45841,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀台","author":"袁宗道","text":"网户珠帘经几春，缕衣歌扇化为尘。\n随风惟有台前柳，犹胜当年缓舞人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45842,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行卫辉野村中即事 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"渚雁沙鸥啛唼，蔬畦麦陇纵横。\n藤萝也解人意，垂蔓争罥前旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45843,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行卫辉野村中即事 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"茆屋犬卧人边，麦陇鸦啼牛背。\n倘逢种柳先生，仆夫停车少待。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45844,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"袁宗道","text":"宝鸭双双引使车，都梁旖旎散郊墟。\n腐儒低首还私忆，走马红尘三月初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45845,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过郾城读公孙大娘弟子舞剑诗有感，弟子郾城人也","author":"袁宗道","text":"一落书生口，魂香不计年。\n须眉元别驾，翻托李娘传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发遂平","author":"袁宗道","text":"遂亭城外少风尘，夏云千层山万层。\n一片云山不可辨，相错还成绮谷纹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45847,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其一","author":"袁宗道","text":"巉岩绕畛畦，小径通车马。\n即此是桃源，问津何为者。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其二","author":"袁宗道","text":"四顾忽无径，仆夫何所往。\n俄闻车马喧，疑在空中响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其三","author":"袁宗道","text":"山下无人踪，山上无鸟语。\n惟馀一片云，见我来游此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其四","author":"袁宗道","text":"云中忽吠呜，岂是刘安宅。\n近者爨烟青，人家枕山脊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其五","author":"袁宗道","text":"仆夫顾且惊，于菟啼林薮。\n乃是巉岩傍，流泉挟石吼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信阳道中即事 其六","author":"袁宗道","text":"桥上山崚崚，桥边石齿齿。\n差畅游人怀，奈伤驭者趾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中看云","author":"袁宗道","text":"雪学嵯峨山，山似霮䨴云。\n云